{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c68f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0837a-1c79-7da0-8182-80fcc24d0f57"},"sequence":418,"recorded_at":1780531400000831,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"cc62db48-2d5f-4993-aed4-3308f961b0cf","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"cc62db48-2d5f-4993-aed4-3308f961b0cf","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"cc62db48-2d5f-4993-aed4-3308f961b0cf"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"39cc312b-6dc5-4162-979a-da2a8c2f2e2e"},"task_id":"39cc312b-6dc5-4162-979a-da2a8c2f2e2e","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"39cc312b-6dc5-4162-979a-da2a8c2f2e2e","chunk":"Read text file `README.md`.\n(2473 line(s) above)\n2474|install `project-management`; development uses the globally installed skill\n2475|and `task-board` CLI.\n2476|\n2477|Repository development routing in `task-board.config.json` admits Muse\n2478|`muse-spark` with `xhigh` reasoning and Codex `gpt-6-astra` with `medium` or\n2479|`high` reasoning for new spawns. Producers recommend Muse Spark xhigh first;\n2480|reviewers are restricted to Codex Astra medium by the reviewer role ceiling\n2481|and its medium default, and the review workload recommends medium only.\n2482|Architecture workloads stay Codex Astra high then medium. Mechanical,\n2483|documentation, and operations workloads recommend Muse xhigh, then Codex\n2484|medium, then Codex high; all other producer workloads recommend Muse xhigh,\n2485|then Codex high, then Codex medium. The mixed allow-set is limited to Muse\n2486|and Codex: other providers are refused, and the retained Claude ceiling\n2487|definition is inactive under mixed admission. Existing runs and their work\n2488|are preserved.\n2489|\n2490|Inspect effective admission and recommendations before spawning:\n2491|\n2492|```bash\n2493|task-board q 'project_config(view=spawn-preflight, role=developer, agent=muse, workload_class=mechanical)'\n2494|task-board q 'project_config(view=spawn-preflight, role=reviewer, agent=codex, workload_class=review)'\n2495|```\n2496|\n2497|Preflight prints JSON to stdout; save task validation evidence under\n2498|`.temp/<TASK-ID>/` and attach it to the owning board item.\n2499|\n2500|Curator owns `.agents/`, `.claude/skills/`, and `.codex/skills/`. Do not edit\n2501|their generated contents directly; change `Skillfile.json` and rerun Curator.\n2502|\n2503|## Tools and Outputs\n(more lines below)"}}}
