{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c767","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0837a-1c79-7da0-8182-80fcc24d0f57"},"sequence":526,"recorded_at":1780531400001047,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"cc62db48-2d5f-4993-aed4-3308f961b0cf","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"cc62db48-2d5f-4993-aed4-3308f961b0cf","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"cc62db48-2d5f-4993-aed4-3308f961b0cf"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"ae6fac16-d06d-4658-8b74-8a437c4a1614"},"task_id":"ae6fac16-d06d-4658-8b74-8a437c4a1614","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"ae6fac16-d06d-4658-8b74-8a437c4a1614","chunk":"Read text file `.temp/TASK-260909-3kvql5/rev2/outcome-rev2-draft.md`.\n1|# TASK-260909-3kvql5 outcome: admit Muse producers + medium Astra reviewers\n2|\n3|## Provenance (explicit-config bootstrap)\n4|\n5|This run was spawned through the supported explicit `TASK_BOARD_CONFIG` source\n6|(`.../.temp/TASK-260909-3kvql5/approved-runtime-config.json`, immutable\n7|operational input, NOT modified) because the canonical config was still\n8|exclusive-Codex. The approved file served as policy reference only. Root\n9|runtime, control repository and board authority remain this AX repository.\n10|Canonical preflights below were run with `TASK_BOARD_CONFIG` overridden to the\n11|worktree candidate file (read-only queries); post-landing preflights on the\n12|default source must re-prove the real policy.\n13|\n14|## Candidate identity (uncommitted, Story worktree)\n15|\n16|- Branch: `task-board/story/STORY-260909-2uobs6` (no producer commit made)\n17|- Base HEAD: `7654d7cadb2c226bfa3db5f23ac355a730285eea`\n18|- `task-board.config.json` sha256: `ac85fa77b01f0f0d07a9831965504731b627660abb6ea5983c25809c53134e6b`\n19|- Changed paths (2, policy scope only): `task-board.config.json`, `README.md`\n20|- Candidate `task-board.config.json` is byte-identical to the approved runtime\n21|  config (`diff` clean); `git diff` vs HEAD is confined to the authorized delta.\n22|\n23|## Change (authorized delta only)\n24|\n25|1. `spawn.preferred_agentic_system`: `{\"exclusive\":\"codex\"}` ->\n26|   `{\"mixed\":[\"muse\",\"codex\"]}`.\n27|2. `spawn.ceilings.codex.roles.reviewer` added: Astra medium-only entries with\n28|   `default_model gpt-6-astra` / `default_reasoning_effort medium`.\n29|3. `spawn.workload_classes`: `muse/muse-spark/xhigh` inserted rank 1 in every\n30|   producer class (unified, implementation, mechanical, debugging, testing,\n31|   research, documentation, migration, operations); `review` reduced to\n32|   Codex Astra medium only; `architecture` unchanged (Codex high, medium).\n33|4. README model-routing paragraph aligned (Muse-first producers, medium-only\n34|   Astra reviewers with role default, architecture high-then-medium,\n35|   mechanical/documentation/operations Muse xhigh > Codex medium > Codex high,\n36|   mixed allow-set limited to Muse+Codex, retained Claude ceiling inactive,\n37|   existing runs preserved); preflight examples updated to\n38|   `developer/muse/mechanical` and `reviewer/codex/review`.\n39|5. Preserved byte-identical: `mode`, `local`, `version_control`, `features`,\n40|   `spawn.enabled`, `max_parallel`, all provider ceiling entries/models,\n41|   `worktree_isolation.validation` commands, `.github` (no CI/delivery change).\n42|\n43|## Command exits (all run directly, exit codes real)\n44|\n45|| Command | Exit | Result |\n46|| --- | --- | --- |\n47|| preflight battery (8 checks, production entry point `task-board q 'project_config(view=spawn-preflight,…)'`) on candidate | 0 | 8/8 PASS |\n48|| mutant harness (4 mutants x full battery + static checks) | 0 (harness); nonzero batteries as expected | all mutants killed (see table) |\n49|| `git ls-files -z '*.json' \\| xargs … json.load` | 0 | all JSON parse |\n50|| `git diff --check` | 0 | clean |\n51|| gofmt gate (`gofmt -l` over tracked+untracked go files) | 0 | clean |\n52|| `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...` | 0 | pass |\n53|| `GOOS=linux/windows GOARCH=amd64 go build ./...` | 0 | pass |\n54|| `go test ./internal/canonicaljson -run TestConfiguredValidationRunsEveryFuzzTargetWithFixedBudget` | 0 | PASS (config-coupled: validation commands preserved) |\n55|| `go test ./... -count=1` | 0 | all 23 packages ok |\n56|| `go test ./... -cover -count=1` | 0 | ok (e.g. secprim 94.4%, secconftest 92.6%) |\n57|| `task-board validate` | 0 | 233 pre-existing board ledger-mirror lints, unchanged by this edit (233 before and after; config adds none) |\n58|\n59|## AC coverage: 6 of 8 rows driven; 2 stated bounds\n60|\n61|Driven through `task-board q project_config(view=spawn-preflight,…)` unless noted:\n62|1. Developer Muse xhigh preflight succeeds — P1 (`developer/muse/mechanical`\n63|   rank 1 `muse-spark/xhigh`) and P4 (default routing Muse-first). Driven.\n64|2. Reviewer Astra medium preflight succeeds — P2 (admitted, recs medium-only). Driven.\n65|3. Review role default + recommendations prefer medium — P2 (`resolved_role_default`\n66|   `gpt-6-astra/medium`) + N3 (recs exactly `[medium]`, len 1). Driven.\n67|4. Reviewer high not admitted — N1 (`resolved_role_ceiling` models exactly\n68|   `[{gpt-6-astra:[medium]}]`; no `reasoning_effort` arg exists on preflight, so the\n69|   ceiling object is the refusal surface). Driven.\n70|5. Other providers excluded — N2a/N2b (`agent=claude`, `agent=gemini` refused with\n71|   `agent_not_allowed_by_preferred_agentic_system`; claude refused despite its retained\n72|   ceiling entry, proving ceilings do not imply admission). Driven.\n73|6. JSON + focused config checks pass — rows above. Driven.\n74|7. Orchestrator Astra high/medium usable — P3 (`developer/codex/architecture`\n75|   recs high rank 1, medium rank 2). Driven.\n76|8. No unrelated runtime/hosted CI — `git diff --stat` (2 files), non-policy-field\n77|   assertion script, `.github` untouched. Driven.\n78|- Bound A (not drivable here): independent